Hi Sam,
There have been a bunch of last-minute cancellations and while I have been =
able to fill them, I have had to shuffle some people around. I now have you=
 in site A42 at Tugman, which is still the relief greeter position, just no=
t at Umpqua. I know you wanted to try both parks but maybe we can switch yo=
ur September assignment as well? I hope this is alright. You can stay in A4=
2 on the 31st.

________________________________
